{"seq":3,"slug":"dialectical-argumentation","title":"研究生 逻辑学与方法论 — 辩证论辩","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/philosophy/logic-methodology/argumentation/dialectical-argumentation","wordCount":2487,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"研究生-逻辑学与方法论-辩证论辩\">研究生 逻辑学与方法论 — 辩证论辩</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>辩证论辩（Dialectical Argumentation）将论证从&quot;独白式&quot;的单向推理扩展为&quot;对话式&quot;的多方互动过程。在现实中，论证很少是一个人孤立地从前提推导结论——它们通常发生在对话、辩论和协商的语境中，涉及立场的攻防、让步与反驳。Douglas Walton 的对话类型理论、Phan Minh Dung 的抽象论辩框架以及计算论辩学（Computational Argumentation）为理解和形式化这种动态过程提供了系统的工具。</p>\n<p>核心内容包括：Walton 的对话类型分类（说服、探究、协商等）、Dung 抽象论辩框架、论辩语义学、以及计算论辩在 AI 中的应用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"walton-的对话类型理论\">Walton 的对话类型理论</h3><p>Douglas Walton 提出了一个影响深远的<strong>对话类型分类法</strong>（Dialogue Typology），认为论辩的合理性标准取决于它所处的对话类型——在不同类型的对话中，同一种论证策略可能是合理的也可能是谬误性的。</p>\n<p><strong>六种基本对话类型</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对话类型</th>\n<th>初始情境</th>\n<th>目标</th>\n<th>举例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>说服对话（Persuasion）</strong></td>\n<td>意见分歧</td>\n<td>让对方接受己方立场</td>\n<td>哲学辩论、法律辩论</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>探究对话（Inquiry）</strong></td>\n<td>知识空白</td>\n<td>共同寻找真理或证据</td>\n<td>科学研究、委员会调查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>协商对话（Negotiation）</strong></td>\n<td>利益冲突</td>\n<td>达成各方可接受的协议</td>\n<td>商务谈判、劳资协商</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>信息寻求对话（Information Seeking）</strong></td>\n<td>信息不对称</td>\n<td>一方从另一方获取信息</td>\n<td>课堂提问、新闻采访</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>审议对话（Deliberation）</strong></td>\n<td>行动选择困难</td>\n<td>决定最佳行动方案</td>\n<td>政策讨论、团队决策</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>争吵（Eristic）</strong></td>\n<td>人际冲突</td>\n<td>攻击对方、发泄情绪</td>\n<td>口角、网络骂战</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>对话类型与谬误的关系</strong>：一种论证策略在某种对话类型中合理，在另一种中可能是谬误。例如：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>诉诸情感</strong>在说服对话中可能是谬误（应以理性论证为主），但在审议对话中表达对受影响群体的同情是合理的</li>\n<li><strong>诉诸权威</strong>在探究对话中需要特别谨慎（真理不由权威决定），但在信息寻求对话中引用专家意见是正当的</li>\n<li><strong>人身攻击</strong>在任何对话类型中几乎都是谬误，但在法律交叉询问中质疑证人的可信度是允许的</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>对话转移（Dialectical Shift）</strong>：当参与者将对话从一种类型悄悄转移到另一种类型时，就发生了对话转移。例如，一场学术探究对话逐渐变成了两位学者之间的个人争吵——这种转移通常是不合理的，因为它改变了论证的评估标准而参与者并未意识到。</p>\n<h3 id=\"dung-抽象论辩框架\">Dung 抽象论辩框架</h3><p><strong>Phan Minh Dung</strong> 在1995年的论文 &quot;On the Acceptability of Arguments and its Fundamental Role in Nonmonotonic Reasoning, Logic Programming and n-Person Games&quot; 中提出了<strong>抽象论辩框架（Abstract Argumentation Framework, AF）</strong>——这是计算论辩学的奠基性工作。</p>\n<p><strong>形式化定义</strong>：</p>\n<p>一个抽象论辩框架是一个有向图 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">A</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AF = \\langle \\mathcal{A}, \\mathcal{R} \\rangle</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⟨</span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">A</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">R</span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span></span></span></span></span>，其中：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{A}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 是一个有限集合，元素称为<strong>论证（Arguments）</strong></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">R</mi><mo>⊆</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">A</mi><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{R} \\subseteq \\mathcal{A} \\times \\mathcal{A}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊆</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 是<strong>攻击关系（Attack Relation）</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(a, b) \\in \\mathcal{R}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 表示论证 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 攻击论证 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p><strong>抽象性</strong> 是该框架最显著的特征：它不关心论证的内部结构或攻击的具体理由——只关心论证之间的攻击拓扑。这种高度抽象使其成为统一各种具体论辩系统的元理论。</p>\n<p><strong>核心概念——可接受性</strong>：</p>\n<p>哪些论证是&quot;可接受的&quot;？Dung 定义了以下语义学：</p>\n<p><strong>无冲突集（Conflict-free Set）</strong>：论证集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>⊆</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S \\subseteq \\mathcal{A}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊆</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 是无冲突的，当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 中不存在两个论证互相攻击。</p>\n<p><strong>可辩护（Defense）</strong>：集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 辩护论证 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span>，当且仅当对每个攻击 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 的论证 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 中存在某个论证 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 攻击 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p><strong>可容许集（Admissible Set）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 是无冲突的且辩护其中的每个论证。</p>\n<p>基于这些概念，Dung 定义了多种语义学（Extension Semantics）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>语义学</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>直觉</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>完备扩展（Complete）</strong></td>\n<td>可容许集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 包含所有被 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 辩护的论证</td>\n<td>不遗漏可辩护的论证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>基础扩展（Grounded）</strong></td>\n<td>最小的完备扩展</td>\n<td>最保守的立场：只接受&quot;必须接受&quot;的论证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>优选扩展（Preferred）</strong></td>\n<td>最大的可容许集</td>\n<td>最大化接受的论证（可能有多个）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>稳定扩展（Stable）</strong></td>\n<td>无冲突集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 攻击 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">A</mi><mo>∖</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{A} \\setminus S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∖</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 中的每个论证</td>\n<td>对每个论证都&quot;表态&quot;（接受或拒绝）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>示例</strong>：</p>\n<p>考虑三个论证 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a, b, c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>，攻击关系为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a \\to b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b \\to c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>基础扩展：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{a, c\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 无人攻击所以被接受，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 攻击了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 不被接受，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 因 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 被击败而不再被攻击，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 也被接受）</li>\n<li>优选扩展：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{a, c\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>稳定扩展：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{a, c\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>（因为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 攻击了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>，覆盖了所有不在集合中的论证）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"论辩语义学的哲学意义\">论辩语义学的哲学意义</h3><p>Dung 框架的不同语义学反映了不同的&quot;理性态度&quot;：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>基础语义学</strong>对应<strong>怀疑论立场</strong>：只接受绝对无法被击败的论证。面对争议宁可悬置判断。</li>\n<li><strong>优选/稳定语义学</strong>对应<strong>可信论立场</strong>：在不自我矛盾的前提下尽可能多地接受论证。允许多种合理的立场（多个扩展）共存。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这种对应揭示了论辩理论与认识论之间的深层联系：什么论证应该被接受，本质上是一个认识论问题。</p>\n<h3 id=\"结构化论辩\">结构化论辩</h3><p>抽象论辩框架的一个扩展方向是<strong>结构化论辩（Structured Argumentation）</strong>——为论证提供内部结构，使攻击关系不再是手动指定的而是从论证内容自动生成的。</p>\n<p>主要的结构化论辩系统包括：</p>\n<p><strong>ASPIC+</strong> 框架：论证由推理规则构建，攻击类型包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>反驳（Rebutting）</strong>：结论之间的矛盾</li>\n<li><strong>削弱（Undercutting）</strong>：质疑推理规则的适用性</li>\n<li><strong>前提攻击（Undermining）</strong>：质疑前提的真实性</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>ABA（Assumption-Based Argumentation）</strong>：论证基于假设构建，攻击通过否定假设来实现。</p>\n<p><strong>DeLP（Defeasible Logic Programming）</strong>：结合逻辑编程和可废除推理，论证是程序中的推导。</p>\n<h3 id=\"计算论辩在-ai-中的应用\">计算论辩在 AI 中的应用</h3><p><strong>自动化辩论系统</strong>：IBM 的 Project Debater 是首个能与人类进行竞技辩论的 AI 系统。它结合了信息检索、论点挖掘和论辩策略来构建连贯的辩论演讲。</p>\n<p><strong>多智能体协商</strong>：在多智能体系统中，自主代理需要通过论辩来协调行动、解决冲突。论辩框架提供了形式化的协商协议。</p>\n<p><strong>法律推理</strong>：法律论证天然具有辩证性——控辩双方提出论点和反驳。论辩框架已被应用于法律判决的形式化建模。</p>\n<p><strong>在线辩论平台</strong>：Kialo 等平台使用论辩树（Argumentation Tree）来组织用户讨论，使论点和反驳的结构清晰可见。</p>\n<p><strong>可解释 AI</strong>：论辩框架被用于解释 AI 决策——不仅展示结论，还展示支持和反对该结论的论证以及它们之间的攻防关系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p><strong>对话类型分析</strong>：以下场景分别属于哪种 Walton 对话类型？(a) 法庭上律师的陈词；(b) 同事讨论午餐去哪吃；(c) 导师和学生讨论论文的研究方向。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>Dung 框架练习</strong>：给定论辩框架 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">A</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{A} = \\{a, b, c, d\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>，攻击关系 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>b</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>d</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a \\to b, b \\to c, c \\to d, d \\to c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>。求其基础扩展和所有优选扩展。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>语义学比较</strong>：解释为什么稳定扩展不一定存在（构造一个三个论证构成循环攻击的例子），而基础扩展总是存在的。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>对话转移识别</strong>：在一段网络讨论中找到一个从探究对话转移为争吵的例子。分析转移是如何发生的，以及它如何改变了论证的评估标准。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>应用思考</strong>：如果要设计一个帮助学术同行评审的 AI 系统，你会如何利用论辩框架来组织审稿意见和作者回复之间的攻防关系？</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>Douglas Walton 的 <em>Dialog Theory for Critical Argumentation</em> 系统阐述了对话类型理论</li>\n<li>Phan Minh Dung 的1995年原始论文是抽象论辩框架的必读文献，虽然技术性强但思想清晰</li>\n<li>Pietro Baroni、Federico Cerutti 等编辑的 <em>Handbook of Formal Argumentation</em> 是该领域最全面的参考书</li>\n<li>Iyad Rahwan 和 Guillermo Simari 编辑的 <em>Argumentation in Artificial Intelligence</em> 全面覆盖了计算论辩的 AI 应用</li>\n<li>Stanford Encyclopedia of Philosophy 的 &quot;Computational Argumentation&quot; 词条提供了该领域的哲学和技术概述</li>\n<li>对 IBM Project Debater 感兴趣的读者可访问其官方技术文档和发表在 Nature 上的论文</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>辩证论辩理论将论证从静态的逻辑分析扩展到动态的对话过程。Walton 的对话类型分类揭示了论证合理性的语境依赖性——相同的论证策略在不同对话类型中可能合理也可能谬误。Dung 的抽象论辩框架以优雅的图论方法形式化了论证之间的攻防关系，并通过不同的语义学刻画了从怀疑论到可信论的各种理性立场。计算论辩学将这些理论工具带入了人工智能领域，为自动辩论、多智能体协商和可解释 AI 提供了基础。辩证论辩提醒我们，论证不仅是逻辑推理，更是社会互动——理解论证就必须理解它所嵌入的对话语境。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"研究生 逻辑学与方法论 — 辩证论辩","id":"研究生-逻辑学与方法论-辩证论辩"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"Walton 的对话类型理论","id":"walton-的对话类型理论"},{"level":3,"text":"Dung 抽象论辩框架","id":"dung-抽象论辩框架"},{"level":3,"text":"论辩语义学的哲学意义","id":"论辩语义学的哲学意义"},{"level":3,"text":"结构化论辩","id":"结构化论辩"},{"level":3,"text":"计算论辩在 AI 中的应用","id":"计算论辩在-ai-中的应用"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"研究生 逻辑学与方法论 — 谬误分析","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/philosophy/logic-methodology/argumentation/fallacies-analysis"},"next":{"title":"研究生 逻辑学与方法论 — 概念分析","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/philosophy/logic-methodology/methodology-seminar/conceptual-analysis"}}